  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AX3-005" ;
  triage:title "C7 mark_source_acknowledged helper never extracted; completion-from-Assigned bypasses the message-store path with a raw SQL UPDATE" ;
  triage:description "Code contract C7 requires extracting mark_source_acknowledged(source: &mut Message, now) from execute_acknowledgement's inline mutation and reusing it in the completion-from-Assigned path. The function does not exist anywhere at 88c579a18; the completion path issues a raw UPDATE mail_message_states directly, bypassing execute_upsert_message and its side effects, so two independent mutation mechanisms exist for the same semantic. Found by ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-F002 and req-qa ATM-QA-002 on PR #1191 QA-1." ;
